{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_05",
  "title": "逃票？",
  "storyCode": "RS-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9f1a364ed1bf7676096449364d742f0fed58e6356fa18f1c434d6cc4efdefdb9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事……？地上怎麼這麼多空酒瓶子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……怪了，我怎麼會睡在會客廳地板上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅莎琳……好孩子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……阿克托斯……這個……混帳東西……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（鼾聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吵什麼！連個安穩覺都不讓人睡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，慢著，我這是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸！您什麼時候回來的，怎麼也不提前讓人帶話說一聲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天這是怎麼回事，我們怎麼都睡到地上去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……別瞎嚷嚷，吵得我頭痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，還有大老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，你們可算醒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古羅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天這是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天老爺和大老爺都喝醉了，說是要不醉不休，說什麼都不願意回房間睡，我們怎麼勸都不成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒辦法，只好往爐子裡多添了兩把柴，這樣至少不會冷著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，昨天的事你不記得了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……等會，你讓我想想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天，昨天……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得，昨天我是要給耶拉岡德像落成儀式的前夜晚會做準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖女大人要我選出謝拉格最好的酒水，用來招待來客，所以我就挨個嚐了嚐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，然後我就不大記得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，你自然是不記得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你喝得爛醉連人都分不清，還抱著柱子要跟人家乾杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都多大年紀了，丟臉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，爸，我這不也是為了聖女大人，為了謝拉格嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古羅還在這呢，你少罵我兩句，給我留點面子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來都教你，面子裏子都是自己掙的，光要我留給你有什麼用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……算了，先不跟你計較。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古羅，怎麼沒瞧見羅莎琳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大老爺，羅莎琳小姐一早就上山去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅莎琳小姐醒得早，老爺和大老爺那會都還沒醒，小姐就說，乾脆讓你們再睡會兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想著也是，就沒喊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她就這樣走了，也好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許，或許這就是耶拉岡德為我佩爾羅契家所做的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見面不識，這是緣分未夠，緣分未夠啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸，你這又打什麼啞謎呢？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我隱約記得昨天是來了個小丫頭沒錯，不過我確實是醉得不輕，不大想得起來那丫頭的長相了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說，那丫頭叫羅莎琳？這名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯，你過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此事，我不該瞞你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "便如當初，亦是你自己做了選擇一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如今該如何做，終究需你自己決斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……耶拉岡德在上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這祖孫三代真的就喝了整整一宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還把我和其他護衛一起拉上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好久沒有喝過這麼多酒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_283_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，真的一點正事都沒說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……既然側面行不通，那麼，乾脆從正面來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看這個方向，羅莎琳小姐是往山上去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔——這就是雪山啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "近看比遠看還要更壯觀，謝拉格的山還是有點真本事的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，有點頭暈，昨天真的喝多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道那老伯和叔叔醒了沒有，博士怎麼沒告訴我，謝拉格人竟然這麼熱情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等回頭下山，再送點什麼過去做謝禮吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶，真冷，這風刮得人身上怪疼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得……這山好像是得自己爬上去，才是對耶拉岡德信仰虔誠來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……難得來一次，那就試試好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪山上最純淨的空氣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來挺不錯的，你們這能刷卡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那我要兩箱，直接送到馱峰飯店606號房。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明商人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，佐菲婭姐姐，你又買這麼多啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天你還買了四箱什麼雪山泉水，這麼多東西，我們要怎麼帶回去啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傻！哪用我們自己帶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回頭給瑪恩納和瑪嘉烈各寄一部分，這麼看我買得還不夠多呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝拉格的空氣和水確實都不錯，黑騎士當初選擇了這裡，現在日子應該也過得很好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，不說這個。聽說這謝拉格的雪山需要親自攀爬登頂，才算虔誠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我們也試試！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，這本旅遊手冊上也是這麼寫的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國遊客B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "佐菲婭姐姐，我們來比一比，誰最先到山頂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊利老爹，你怎不告訴她們，我們已經有上山的纜車啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯嚯嚯，遊客們有自己的主意，老頭子就不過去添亂囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那倒也是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看這些遊客還都蠻喜歡爬山的，現在也就他們愛爬了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，她們那些話說得也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走了！坐纜車去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真坐？這不算對耶拉岡德信仰不堅定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算什麼算！這是耶拉岡德愛惜子民，才給我們的便利！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子若是還堅持不坐，那才是對耶拉岡德信仰不堅定！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊什麼啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們都是耶拉岡德的子民，只要你不對耶拉岡德不敬，心裡想著耶拉岡德，耶拉岡德自然會保佑我們的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好險，山上居然還有纜車可坐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼哪裡的景點都一個樣……不跟著當地人走，就是容易吃點虧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然不知道到底怎麼才算是對耶拉岡德信仰堅定……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但看謝拉格眼下這情況，耶拉岡德應該還挺保佑這裡的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，前面的老人家！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問纜車的票在哪買？勞您指個方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生，請留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰？怎麼這副打扮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的，我是來自維多利亞的記者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然人們都說這耶拉岡德像好，但是，建造這種東西肯定是勞民傷財的，我正在收集一些——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我兒子每個月都會把錢寄回來，還會給我打電話，說在那邊工作得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這些外國人，就是見不得我們謝拉格的好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，他為什麼不回來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說他簽了一些什麼什麼協議，要在那邊待著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼協議來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保密協議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……建雕像也需要保密協議嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我告訴你，外國佬，你要是想編派我們耶拉岡德，我現在就給你一拐杖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謝拉格老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_279_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g1_snowyforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，哼哼哼，讚美耶拉岡德……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勇敢的馱獸~勇敢的人~耶拉岡德教導我們~護佑家園，哼哼~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，哼哼哼……♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這雪怎麼有點不對勁……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎喲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下面是個陷阱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒摔到吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，鐧小姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這哪來的坑……肯定是萊利那老傢伙為了抓野味挖的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是多謝你啊鐧小姐，要不是你，俺這肯定就踩空滑下去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事，不用客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鐧小姐今天要上山辦事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼要俺們幫忙的不？俺和萊利、雷昂他們幾個老傢伙今天約好了上山，有什麼事儘管吩咐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是要上山有點事，但不用幫忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和老萊利還在跟維多利亞人喝酒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我們兩邊拼酒，現在平手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰都不服氣咧，這喝酒要是輸給那群維多利亞來的，多給恩希歐迪斯老爺，還有聖女大人丟臉啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且這維多利亞人突然跑來俺們這，還紮營住下了，你說這算什麼事兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算俺沒讀過什麼書，也知道突然湧過來這麼大群人，還各個虎背熊腰粗壯實得很，一定不是什麼好事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺和老萊利就想著，俺們藉著一起喝酒，至少要替恩希歐迪斯老爺把這群人給盯住囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你放心，鐧小姐，我們一定能贏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，能喝吐他們最好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行就叫我，別太勉強。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盯著維多利亞人這事，是你們自己想出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，俺們和其他老鄉一起想的主意。鄉親都都是同意的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在日子越來越好，大夥都知道好歹，誰都別想把俺們的好日子擾亂囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過鐧小姐，俺說句實在話，你別生氣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，你儘管說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是想說啊，俺們這不是跟維多利亞來的一起喝酒嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這群維多利亞人，俺們這一個月也算是有些了解，別的不說，他們人其實真不壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝醉了，也沒給俺們添多少麻煩，平常偶爾還會幫忙做點事什麼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有個和俺差不多年紀的老骨頭，喝多了耍酒瘋也不幹別的，就脫了衣服要跳雪裡游泳，我就看他那背啊，全部是傷痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不知道這是受了多少罪，想想就覺得痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這事你們知道也無妨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次這位維多利亞子爵閣下來慶賀耶拉岡德像落成，帶來的人都是他手下的親兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大多都是跟著他征戰已久的老兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們只是一起喝酒，不必考慮太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。這什麼親兵不親兵的，俺可搞不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過他們那群人確實看著年紀都不輕了，有幾個小伙子，但看著好像身上都長了石頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那應該是之前宣傳過的，那個什麼石頭病吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……礦石病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平日接觸沒什麼，不用太緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，該有的防範還是要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以去羅德島在城裡的辦事處，或是剛建好的醫院，在那都能拿到防護手冊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些俺們懂，鐧小姐別擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺也就是和鐧小姐多廢話兩句，要是恩希歐迪斯老爺和諾希斯老爺，那俺可不敢打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說，我看起來很閒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺不是這個意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是，幾位老爺整天忙大事，俺們也不好打擾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鐧小姐雖然也忙，但平常總幫著俺們，俺們都知道你是跟俺們站一塊的，那就是自己人嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自己人……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不對，欸，幾位老爺也是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺嘴笨，反正就是那個意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是耽誤鐧小姐時間了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我這有件事要麻煩你，還有山上的老萊利他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一句話的事，儘管吩咐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫我找到一個裝模作樣的維多利亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "裝模作樣的維多利亞人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴著禮帽，穿黑色大衣，領子遮著臉，身上還掛著寶石裝飾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很顯眼，一眼就認得出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這人幹嘛，在我們謝拉格穿成這樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概不怎麼聰明吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，包在俺身上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "悠閒的老鄉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一有消息，俺就讓老雷昂家的馱獸幫鐧小姐你送過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸，你說的是真的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨天的那丫頭……羅莎琳她、她是我的女兒？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應當不會錯。那孩子的長相，像你，也像塔季揚娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子眼還沒花，不會認錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女兒……我的女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈！我就說那是個好丫頭，長得也好，個性也好！好啊，好丫頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅莎琳，羅莎琳……她長得像我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，是像我，我想起來了，那丫頭是棕色頭髮，跟我一樣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "眼睛嘴巴都像塔季揚娜，尤其是眼睛，和塔季揚娜一模一樣！多好看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這時間過得真快，一轉眼小羅莎琳都長這麼大了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，羅莎琳上山去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那她什麼時候回來？她還會回來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯，還有件事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸，我得去幫我閨女準備點禮物，有什麼事回頭再說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得她小的時候最喜歡烤甜乳酪，還有獸肉燉菜，我現在就去買！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有塔季揚娜，塔季揚娜是不是也來了？她是不是不願意見我？那我、我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！不管了，我直接上山一趟，把東西給羅莎琳送過去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後再問問她塔季揚娜的事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了，爸，我得把握點時間——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你給我站住！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你站住，還有些事，你得知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿克托斯被父親喝止在原地，心中不禁生出些許不好的預感。\n或許是宿醉的緣故，他突然感到頭痛難忍，胃沉沉下墜，冷意不知從哪裡鑽出，爬上背脊。\n阿克托斯此時才發現許久未見的父親背脊已略微佝僂，不復記憶中的高大，像株逐漸枯萎的大樹。\n年老的修士那乾枯的聲音並未因阿克托斯的心慌而停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅莎琳那孩子說，她和母親一起離開後，一直定居在烏薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那孩子離開的時候太小了，還記不住事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她說這麼些年，她從來不知父親是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這趟回來，除了要好好看看我們的耶拉岡德像，還有就是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "送她母親的遺物回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "壞的預感似乎總會成真。\n屋外呼嘯的風雪，屋內跳動的爐火，連帶分不出屬於誰的呼吸聲似乎都短暫地靜止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遺物……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可、可是塔季揚娜還那麼年輕，怎麼會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不可能……這怎麼可能……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子親耳所聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯，當年的事……是我們佩羅爾契家對不起她們母女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子心中有愧，卻無悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿克托斯，你又如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，不管你要說什麼，與我說都無用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你爹我不是完人，也不是聖人，更不是受害者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子老了，聽不了你要說的話，更指點不了你什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟願今後日日清掃耶拉岡德足下塵土，以此度過餘生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你……自己好好想想吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔季揚娜……羅莎琳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爺，大老爺！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "古羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_260_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "菈塔托絲夫人來訪，說有急事要談！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，好大的酒味……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天就是儀式了，阿克托斯，你可別現在喝酒誤事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我現在沒心情跟你唱戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說吧，出什麼事了。沒事你菈塔托絲可不會登門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，你對我倒是很了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，那我就直說了，阿克托斯，我是來給你提個醒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還記得，當年你阿克托斯不顧家裡人反對，娶了一個烏薩斯女人，還生了一個女兒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後希瓦艾什夫婦出事，沒多久你的妻子和女兒便離開謝拉格，這事在我們三家範圍內，可是無人不知啊"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哼，你的鼻子還是這麼靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就當你是在誇我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這次來，就是要跟你說說你的女兒，那個叫羅莎琳的女孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅莎琳她怎麼了，你少借題發揮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿克托斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_254_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和我們三家的事扯不上關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對翻舊帳沒興趣，只不過，她回來的時機實在不巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知不知道這孩子現在在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她很可能已經被維多利亞的密探盯上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g12_mountpath"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終於到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "纜車只能到這裡了，接下來還是得自己爬啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，離山頂也不遠了"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛還能看到幾個遊客的，到這裡就完全沒人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上下左右都是白茫茫的……嘶，怎麼還有點可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……不……運氣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……什、什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……自從到了謝拉格，就沒一件事順利過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰在前面！出、出來！休想嚇我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面那是……是個坑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰這麼無聊在路邊挖坑，不對，這肯定不是單純的坑……"
